#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:7 src/startup.py:10
#: src/window.ui:5
msgid "Gnollama"
msgstr "Gnollama"

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:8
msgid "Chat with Ollama models"
msgstr "Zungumza na modeli za Ollama"

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Chat with Ollama models running on your computer or a remote server using a native "
"GNOME interface."
msgstr ""
"Zungumza na modeli za Ollama zinazoendeshwa kwenye kompyuta yako au seva ya mbali "
"kupitia kiolesura asilia cha GNOME."

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:11
msgid ""
"Keep conversations in separate tabs, attach images to vision models, and read "
"responses with Markdown and highlighted code."
msgstr ""
"Weka mazungumzo kwenye vichupo tofauti, ambatisha picha kwa modeli zinazochakata "
"picha, na usome majibu yenye Markdown na msimbo ulioangaziwa."

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:12
msgid ""
"Manage hosts and models, customize generation and thinking settings, and inspect "
"response statistics including cached prompt tokens."
msgstr ""
"Dhibiti seva na modeli, rekebisha mipangilio ya uzalishaji na ufikiri, na ukague "
"takwimu za majibu, zikiwemo tokeni za ingizo zilizohifadhiwa kwenye akiba."

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid ""
"Generate and validate structured JSON, import JSON schemas, and export responses. "
"Inspect loaded models and release their memory when finished."
msgstr ""
"Zalisha na uhakiki JSON yenye muundo, leta skima za JSON, na uhamishe majibu. Kagua "
"modeli zilizopakiwa na uachilie kumbukumbu yake ukimaliza."

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:14
msgid ""
"Save and organize conversations with pinning and editable titles. Stop a response at "
"any time and keep its partial answer in your history."
msgstr ""
"Hifadhi na upange mazungumzo kwa kuyabandika na kubadilisha vichwa. Simamisha jibu "
"wakati wowote na uhifadhi sehemu iliyozalishwa kwenye historia yako."

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:18
msgid "jackrabbithanna"
msgstr "jackrabbithanna"

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:46
msgid "Ollama chat with code highlighting"
msgstr "Mazungumzo ya Ollama yenye uangaziaji wa msimbo"

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:53
msgid ""
"Add a Knowledge Library for text and PDF imports, local embedding indexes, and "
"source-grounded chats."
msgstr ""
"Imeongeza Maktaba ya Maarifa kwa kuleta maandishi na PDF, faharasa za vekta za ndani,"
" na mazungumzo yanayotegemea vyanzo."

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:55
msgid ""
"Start with knowledge collections and add text, files, or URLs with explicit "
"destinations and guided previews."
msgstr ""
"Anza na mikusanyiko ya maarifa na uongeze maandishi, faili au URL kwa kuchagua wazi "
"mahali pa kuzihifadhi na kutumia hakiki zenye mwongozo."

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:56
msgid ""
"Choose collections before search settings, and use adaptive chat settings with "
"clearer controls and feedback."
msgstr ""
"Chagua mikusanyiko kabla ya mipangilio ya utafutaji, na utumie mipangilio ya "
"mazungumzo inayojirekebisha kulingana na nafasi, yenye vidhibiti na mrejesho ulio "
"wazi zaidi."

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:57
msgid "Create and compare embeddings, inspect chunks and vectors, and test semantic searches."
msgstr ""
"Unda na ulinganishe viwakilishi vya vekta, kagua vipande na vekta, na ujaribu "
"utafutaji wa kisemantiki."

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:58
msgid ""
"Select documents or chunks for chats, with independent embedding hosts and saved "
"source passages."
msgstr ""
"Chagua hati au vipande kwa mazungumzo, ukitumia seva huru za kuunda vekta na vifungu "
"vya vyanzo vilivyohifadhiwa."

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:59
msgid ""
"Warn about stored embeddings when deleting models, with optional vector cleanup that "
"retains source text."
msgstr ""
"Imeongeza onyo kuhusu viwakilishi vya vekta vilivyohifadhiwa unapofuta modeli, pamoja"
" na chaguo la kufuta vekta huku ukihifadhi maandishi asili."

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:60
msgid ""
"Search with sqlite-vec, automatically migrate existing vectors with a database "
"backup, and use the Qwen3 retrieval preset."
msgstr ""
"Tafuta kwa sqlite-vec, hamisha vekta zilizopo kiotomatiki huku ukihifadhi nakala ya "
"hifadhidata, na utumie wasifu wa utafutaji wa Qwen3."

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:61
msgid ""
"Organize documents into collections with shared embedding settings, automatic builds,"
" and live collection selection in chats."
msgstr ""
"Panga hati katika mikusanyiko yenye mipangilio ya pamoja ya vekta, uundaji wa "
"faharasa kiotomatiki, na uteuzi wa mikusanyiko unaosasishwa moja kwa moja kwenye "
"mazungumzo."

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:62
msgid ""
"Choose collections as chat sources and compare cosine similarity, Euclidean distance,"
" or Manhattan distance with appropriate search cutoffs."
msgstr ""
"Chagua mikusanyiko kama vyanzo vya mazungumzo na ulinganishe mfanano wa kosaini, "
"umbali wa Euclid au umbali wa Manhattan kwa kutumia vizingiti vinavyofaa vya "
"utafutaji."

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:63
msgid ""
"Hide embedding-only models from Chat and Response model selection while keeping them "
"available in Knowledge and Manage Models."
msgstr ""
"Modeli za kuunda vekta pekee zimefichwa katika uteuzi wa modeli za Mazungumzo na "
"Jibu, lakini bado zinapatikana katika Maarifa na Dhibiti Modeli."

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:64
msgid ""
"Import batches of URLs into collections with main-content extraction, CSS selectors, "
"editable previews, and source links in chats."
msgstr ""
"Leta makundi ya URL katika mikusanyiko kwa uchimbaji wa maudhui makuu, viteuzi vya "
"CSS, hakiki zinazoharirika, na viungo vya vyanzo kwenye mazungumzo."

#: data/io.github.jackrabbithanna.Gnollama.metainfo.xml.in:65
msgid ""
"Review changed web documents before replacing their text and rebuilding all affected "
"embedding indexes."
msgstr ""
"Kagua hati za wavuti zilizobadilika kabla ya kubadilisha maandishi yake na kujenga "
"upya faharasa zote za vekta zilizoathiriwa."

