"Modeli ya kuunda vekta imebadilika. Chagua modeli yenye alama asili ya hashi au "
"ujenge faharasa mpya."

#: src/knowledge.py:127
msgid "Unknown embedding format."
msgstr "Umbizo la vekta halijulikani."

#: src/knowledge.py:133
msgid "Embedding prefixes must be no longer than 4,000 characters."
msgstr "Viambishi awali vya vekta havipaswi kuzidi herufi 4,000."

#: src/knowledge.py:142
